<title>LATVIA: C.BANK LAT FIX VS NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</title>
<headline>C.BANK LAT FIX VS NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday</p>
<p>announced the following fixings for the lat against</p>
<p>non-convertible currencies, valid for May 5 to May 11.</p>
<p>    Belarus rouble  1000   0.0217</p>
<p>    Kazakh tenge    1000   7.63</p>
<p>    Azerbaijan mana 1000   0.143</p>
<p>    Uzbek som		  0.0096</p>
<p>    Georgina lari	    0.458</p>
<p>    Armenian dinar  1000   1.39</p>
<p>    Turkmen manat   1000   0.138</p>
<p>    Tadzik rouble   1000   1.420</p>
<p>    Ukraine hryvna	   0.312</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
